        {
          "text": " Naarai ebuni apak naegirioto ituŋa aisisianakin naka aijar, ejaas kaki nuipiete, etukonokinete bonik ikesisianakinak kwape ejaar aiŋobelekec bonik, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
